Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayday! Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is KC-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.65,0:01:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing altitude really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost control of the plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, sir? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no flight crew, and we're\Nabout to slam into a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So get me someone who knows\Nhow to fly this thing and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right away, sir. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down, Kaiba,\Nin more ways than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a riot. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now on with your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my Junk Dealer\NMagic card. With this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can refurbish any two of my\Nmonsters and bring them back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.79,0:01:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,on the field with half of\Ntheir original attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, my science soldier\Nand my cyber soldier of Dark World.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon a third\Nmonster called Kinetic Soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the Seal of Oricalcos,\Nthey all get a power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I flipped the red switch, and now\NI'm trying to level off the aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.69,0:02:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now, Mokuba, pull up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my track.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier Revolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It only works when Science Soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinetic Soldier, and Cyber Soldier\Nare all on the front line together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can send every card you have on\Nthe field straight to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I can destroy every\Ncard in your hand, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I play a devastating\Nmagic card known as Sky Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me sacrifice all\Nthree of my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can summon my ultimate\Nbeast, so he can finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Air Fortress Cigarette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, our radar shows you're\Ntoo close to that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your wheel pulled back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, pull it harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it sir
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now reactivate the autopilot now.\NThat's the best idea I've heard all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto I did it we're safe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance I\Nnow hold the most destructive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,war machine ever created\Nand it's pointed at you Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,did I mention it's powered\Nby the Aurichalcos?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because it's based on my brother's\NDynadude action figure. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the one I carry with me to remind me how\Nyour father took my brother away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,every turn it releases one robot\Ntoken to protect itself from your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,pathetic attacks your move not that\Nanything you do can possibly save
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you now look punk i have no\Nintention of letting your little toys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,stop me and i'm through playing around\Nseto please stop the duel mokuba
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never backed down from a challenge,\Nand I don't plan to start today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if you lose, he\Ngets your soul. Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one thing this Joker's gonna\Nget, and that's the defeat of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I activate my Pot of Greed\NMagic card, so I can draw two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your big plan to\Nbeat me just failed. My plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, is foolproof. I'll\Nreduce you to dust with my ziggurat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, and how appropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to feel the\Nvery agony that my family
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,felt at the hands of your\Nstepfather I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,what he did to you has nothing to do\Nwith Seto Our stepfather was a jerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And we never supported him, Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. We don't have to defend ourselves to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,him right you are in\Nfact there's no way you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,can defend yourself\Nagainst my air fortress
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,ziggurat you might want\Nto start saying your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbyes because it all\Nends right here i've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,been waiting for this\Nday for years and now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it's here my move now\Nair fortress ziggurat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,attack his life points\Ndirectly sky cannon blast
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the rest\Nof your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Air Fortress, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You just triggered my traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap cards can't stop Ziggurat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me use your magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll play a card from your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Junk Dealer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it to bring\Nmy Judge Man back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,field in defense mode to\Nprotect my life points
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal. I still get another robot token.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, on the other hand, are down\Nto your last hundred life points
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my rescue\Nteam's a little early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew they'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we split. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are Cozaboro's copters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He is just like his old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Trifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the ladders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get them off\Nthat plane immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're losing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're completely off the radar, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them. But, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, looks to me like I was\Nright about you all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a heartless tyrant,\Njust like your stepfather Gozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would you use his private\Nair force to protect yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, you think it makes you strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When you cause hurt and misery to innocent\Npeople like my little brother Mikey,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's my move
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have just the car to take\Nyou down I activate soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Exchange now. Each one of us\Ncan choose a monster on our
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,opponent's side of the field\Nto sacrifice go ahead Just
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,try you should be careful\Nwhat you wish for Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It may come true Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't work on my ziggurat anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm using it on\Nyour two little dollies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can call my ultimate\Nmonster to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.87,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue-eyes white dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks can be deceiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk a good game, but deep down I know\Nyou realize there's no way you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:09:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monsters are equal in attack\Nstrength, only mine can't be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place a card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my turn's\Ndone, I get one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.13,0:10:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Another robot token.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets one of those every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it impossible\Nto attack his ziggurat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodbye to your robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes, send his tin can back to the\Ntrash heap with your white lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I put this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to end this duel\Nand complete my brother's vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey, this is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I activate Toy Robot Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is discard\Nthree cards from my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows me to\Nsummon three more robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.99,0:11:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll sacrifice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me play my spell canceler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster prevents you from\Nusing any of your magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my ticket to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon everyone like you will\Nbe erased from this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought you hated violence! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that you and your\Narmy of rejects plan to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,every person who doesn't share\Nthe same lame ideas you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saving Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if people like you continue to\Nexist, the whole world will crumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:12:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if your brother was\Nstill by your side? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you still try to wipe out\Nmankind if that meant hurting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault that he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but don't you think\Nit's time you accepted the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You better explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As a brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it was your duty to protect him at\Nall costs, and you failed, Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little brother was\Ncaptured because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to blame everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziggurat, attack him now\Nwith your Sky Cannon Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Blue Eyes is history!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I plan to save my brother\Nby winning this battle no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you watch and learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:13:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so busy ranting and raving, you\Nfailed to notice my trap card. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Tyrant Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,By adding this card to my blue eyes, I've\Ngiven him an extra 400 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And in case you're in too\Nmuch shock to do the math,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that means now my dragon is strong\Nenough to destroy your ziggurat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you endanger\Nmy brother's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes, end this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your floating trash heap is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I crush your puny\Ndefense, you'll have no monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the power of\Nthe Urikalkos on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And once it destroys this plane, the seal\Nof Oricalcos will absorb all three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you can't win the\Ngame, so you're just giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the biggest coward I've\Never met in my life! You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing all this to\Nsave humanity. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing this because you're\Ntoo scared to face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What would your little brother think\Nif he saw you acting like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Dynadude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon, he'll save us! Mikey...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to have this picture of Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.03,0:14:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just mad at yourself\Nbecause you let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like you\Nlet your brother down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,because you can't save him even if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,we do continue try me you're nuts I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,have three monsters up against your\None dragon you could never defeat me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.49,0:15:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,before this plane goes down even if\NI were to end my turn right now what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,are you waiting for let's duel all I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,need is one more turn give me that and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down and save Mokuba.\NAll right, if you're so confident, then
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead and try to stop me this duel\Nis still on kaiba and i end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,big mistake alistair but you'll see\Nthat for yourself as soon as i draw my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,card this is it my last shot at victory
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,come on it all ends here with this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play the Bond of Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I fuse it together with my Tyrant
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wing Trap Card to form\NTyrant First Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll combine my new dragon with my\NBlue Eyes to form Blue Eyes Tyrant Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my blue eyes, destroy\Nall three of his monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's gonna take his soul, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time I gave\Nthis back to you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the seal captured him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, wait here for me, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save him. I won't let my brother\Nget hurt no matter what. Do you hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This plane won't crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Taya, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dragons just saved that airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's something\Nyou don't see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Tristan! Huh? It's Taya. And Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of Kaiba's planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:18:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:18:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If it isn't the dweeb patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Roll it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So you dueled this guy\Non top of a moving plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you geeks have\Nsomeone else to annoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we can't do this\Nwithout you, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.27,0:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, accept your destiny\Nand help us to stop this evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a dime for every time you used\Nthe word destiny, I'd be even richer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kaiba! Mokuba! Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fine. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Darts, I've just received word\Nfrom our business division. Yes? Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The takeover was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp now belongs to you.
